<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">ARES: Multimodal <span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">A</span>daptive <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">R</span>easoning via Difficulty-Aware Token-Level <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">E</span>ntropy <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">S</span>haping</h1>
